{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WE NEED HEROES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little cats are trapped in the flames and are waiting for you. Gather your courage, overcome obstacles, and save these adorable kitties!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444000/extras/fb05c40b9302d6f9ef04b8db677b6132.poster.avif?t=1762010269\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444000/extras/fb05c40b9302d6f9ef04b8db677b6132.webm?t=1762010269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444000/extras/fb05c40b9302d6f9ef04b8db677b6132.mp4?t=1762010269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR TEAM AND EMBARK ON AN ADVENTURE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online with up to four players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call your friends, form your team, and coordinate your efforts! Or pick your most chaotic group of friends because a little chaos never hurt anyone, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444000/extras/de0a3259b0eed9e76396fde39a96901b.poster.avif?t=1762010269\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444000/extras/de0a3259b0eed9e76396fde39a96901b.webm?t=1762010269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444000/extras/de0a3259b0eed9e76396fde39a96901b.mp4?t=1762010269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR MISSION: EXTINGUISH FIRES AND RESCUE THE CATS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Firefighting Operation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put out those darn fires! Grab your hose, push through obstacles, and work as a team to bring the blaze under control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Where Are the Cats?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adorable kitties need help! Find and rescue them. But be careful\u2014it might be harder to locate them than you think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444000/extras/5baab7750693c1c018cad532676447fb.poster.avif?t=1762010269\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444000/extras/5baab7750693c1c018cad532676447fb.webm?t=1762010269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444000/extras/5baab7750693c1c018cad532676447fb.mp4?t=1762010269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>QUIRKY BUT BRAVE FIREFIGHTERS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What are these moves?!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re jumping off walls, bouncing in the air, and even drifting! But be careful not to harm your teammates, or your heroics might be short-lived.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embrace the Chaos!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While completing your missions, prepare for funny and chaotic moments. Because in this fire brigade, things don\u2019t always go as planned!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444000/extras/93dcc1c2f0238de18a7ac5cfe8ea8a0f.poster.avif?t=1762010269\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444000/extras/93dcc1c2f0238de18a7ac5cfe8ea8a0f.webm?t=1762010269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444000/extras/93dcc1c2f0238de18a7ac5cfe8ea8a0f.mp4?t=1762010269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HARD MODE AND LEADERBOARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your limits in hard mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must complete the level with limited lives. Be cautious, because one mistake could ruin everything! But if you succeed, you can claim the top spot on the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove Yourself to the World!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you the best firefighter? Share your score and show your heroism to the world.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"To The Fire Rescue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3444000/6a1df859f47f61601a35e8697d8fc9413c0f614f.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome to the City","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3444000/8ffcdb129fccd42e0648e3b849258fd4acf111ae.jpg"},{"name":"Pizza Time!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3444000/81d74f00606fd6e8ce25fa2bb68b6b7fe37ea657.jpg"},{"name":"Thin Glass","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3444000/2e1bfad9528930a0bcd6d8ad272e0f373d88394c.jpg"},{"name":"Sssshhhhhhh","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3444000/0aa5bcaa1d8e0b4f9da3c75522940af77af86dae.jpg"},{"name":"Save The Orange Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3444000/f24092e8088d29b0c1dbcb5a070f3868f99c6202.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome to the HELL","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3444000/0e168df0491d9df67f65f6f601338ee944fd7272.jpg"},{"name":"Blue Platform","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/app